WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
This morning, I was headed out the door

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.107
and my wife saw me and she said,

00:00:05.107 --> 00:00:07.377
"Oh, you look fancy today."

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.570
And I didn't know what
she was talking about

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.400
and I looked in the mirror and I realized

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.600
that I wore a shirt with
buttons, a button up shirt.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.590
That passes for fancy

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:18.670
Yeah.
in this COVID

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:19.650
world we're in now.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.134
I always just throw on a T-shirt.

00:00:22.134 --> 00:00:22.967
Right.

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:26.280
And then some sort of jean
jacket and I do the show,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.300
this morning I put on

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.050
a shirt that's completely
normal, you know?

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:32.900
Right.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.130
And it looks like I'm

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.220
headed out the door to my wedding.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.230
It's, it's also a lot of work,

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.690
all those buttons,

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:44.100
that shows a lot of
ambition so kudos to you.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.980
Thank you.
Yeah.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:47.300
It's actually just velcro.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.620
Oh, right.
Yeah.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.400
The buttons are just here and then it just

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.233
Right, right.

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:52.270
flips down and I can rip this off

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.570
and there's no back to this,

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.030
it's just a bare back.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:56.920
I mean, your wife found it fancy,

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:57.830
if that's really--

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:58.740
She didn't see the back,

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.170
if she had seen the back, she
would have been horrified.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.730
Yeah, she would have been,
it probably have been like

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:04.490
you got to get that spot looked at.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:05.323
Yeah.

00:01:05.323 --> 00:01:06.156
Yeah.

00:01:06.156 --> 00:01:09.580
My wife hasn't seen my
naked torso in eight years.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.600
Well, you got to get better lighting.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.770
She said my skin looks like SPAM

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:16.030
that started to go bad.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:16.890
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.940
Yeah, didn't you used to
help out in the health class

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.640
by showing the circulatory system

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.580
by just standing there with a shirt off?

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:24.500
I get paid a lot of money,

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.120
I got $40 a class.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:26.953
Nice.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:27.830
They give you a cookie

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:30.350
and watch it pass through
your digestive tract.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:31.183
Yup.

00:01:31.183 --> 00:01:32.570
It's good work, if you can get it.

